				bark("Then stop wasting my time! When you wish to deal in earnest, you may return. Until that time, you are dismissed. ");
				vardionMad = 1;
			}
			case "Whatever you want, I'll do. "
			{
				bark("Your enthusiasm is encouraging, however, your blind acceptance does not give me much faith in your ability to accomplish the task I've set for you. Ah, well. Only one way to find out. Are you prepared to undertake my task? ");
				local_m06 = <<"Yes, I am prepared. ", "Let me think on it more. ", "I won't do your dirty work! ">>;
				vardionOffer = 1 + vardionOffer;
			}
			case "What do you know of Necromancers? "
			{
				bark("They are the practitioners of the magic of death. ");
				local_m06 -= <<"What do you know of Necromancers? ">>;
				local_m14 = 1;
			}
			case "What can you say about Tempests? "
			{
				bark("Naught but that they provide a service to the people by keeping the storms that plague Pagan away from this island. ");
				local_m06 -= <<"What can you say about Tempests? ">>;
			}
			case "Order of Enlightment? "
			{
				bark("They style themselves as a religious order, following their Mystic Voice. ");
				local_m06 -= <<"Order of Enlightment? ">>;
				local_m06 ^= <<"What is this Mystic Voice? ">>;
			}
			case "What do you know of Theurgists? "
			{
				bark("They practice healing arts and it is said that their leader can even bring the dead back to life. All in all, they are a coven of weak fools afraid to die for a cause. ");
				local_m06 -= <<"What do you know of Theurgists? ">>;
			}
			case "Tell me of this 'blind, old man.' "
			{
				bark("Stellos is his name and some say he's lived forever. I must give credit to this rumor, for he was an old man when I was a boy, and he hasn't changed a bit as I've become a man. ");
				local_m06 -= <<"Tell me of this 'blind, old man.' ">>;
			}
			case "Yes, I am prepared. "
			{
				bark("Excellent. The pact has been made. You will now be my Disciple. I sense that you are one of the rare individuals who the Fire has chosen. The Fire gives you the Truename: Daemion. ");
				bark("Hold tightly to that name. It is your strength and also your weakness. My Truename is Morduin. I give it to you so that you may learn Sorcery from me. Reveal it upon pain of death. ");
				bark("The task you must perform is to gain the Truename of Bane. She is a deceptive and conniving wench. Do not be fooled by her apparent friendliness. It's a ruse. She is power hungry and ambitious. ");
				bark("It is my belief that she seeks the death of the Master and myself in order to become the most powerful Sorcerer of Pagan. This is not a problem in and of itself. It is how she intends to go about it that causes the problem. ");
				bark("Were she to issue the Calling and challenge by the proper methods, I would surely defeat her, but knowing this, she intends to strike clandestinely. The factions that exist in the Enclave will war if this happens. ");
				bark("The possibility of losing control of the Lord of Flame will vastly increase and should this catastrophe come to pass, Pagan will be doomed.*You must hurry. I know not when she will attack. ");
